  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<div><span><span>In </span></span><span><span>mid-January 2025</span><span>, the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL</span><span>&nbsp;Managed Instance</span><span>:&nbsp;</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></div><div><p><span><span></span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div><ul><li><p><span><span>Filter egress traffic</span></span><span><span>&nbsp;to Azure Storage accounts to </span><span>help </span><span>safeguard against data exfiltration.</span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><a href=\"https://aka.ms/sqlmi-sep-docs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span><span>Learn more</span></span></a><span><span>.</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><div><p><span><span></span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></p></div>",
    "Markdown": "In mid-January 2025 , the following updates and enhancements were made to Azure SQL Managed Instance :\n\nFilter egress traffic to Azure Storage accounts to help safeguard against data exfiltration. Learn more ."
  },
